erior margin  The remaining breast tissue is predominantly yellow tan fatty tissue with very scant tan pink unremarkable fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior cavity to skin surface   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior cavity projection   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior medial wall of anterior cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior lateral wall of anterior cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior cavity to the nearest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Inferior wall nodule of posterior cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior wall of posterior cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous tissue medial to posterior cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Fibrous tissue from medial inferior quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   One axillary lymph node bisected   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Axillary area of fibrosis and possible lymph node  Gross Dictation by Paul N Staats  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Paul N Staats  on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
