rformance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Addendum  1 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 23   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 28 09PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  2 RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    HER 2 neu gene in ductal carcinoma in situ tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  There are insufficient numbers of invasive tumor cells for reliable enumeration of HER 2 neu gene amplification  However  the invasive tumor cells show HER 2 signals and chromosome 17 signals similar to those seen in ductal carcinoma in situ tumor cells  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  811  to chromosome 17 signals  162  in 60 in situ tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  Results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be interpreted with caution  Addendum  2 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 07   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06 34 46PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Lymph Node  Left Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART B  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART C  Lymph Node  Right Axilla   Sentin