ial sections are submitted in cassette A  The medial resection margin is taken and radial sections are submitted in cassette B  Representative sections from the first cystic cavity are submitted in cassettes C E and from the second cystic cavity in cassettes F G  Resident  LYNN CORNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  RE EXCISION , Unchecked.
