aining breast parenchyma reveals unremarkable fibroadipose tissue transversed by thick  fibrous bands  SECTION CODE  A J  lymph nodes  K  closest inked margin  deep   L O  representative cross section through biopsy cavity  P Q  representative suspicious medial areas  R  representative suspicious lateral areas  S  areola  T  scar  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST TISSUE  RIGHT    report_end  , Unchecked.
