cal assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  16 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 14 38 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in frozen section lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  s name and unit number and  right breast biopsy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm fragment of breast with wire  Inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  round  firm nodule with focal gritty  white areas present at the inked resection margin  A piece is frozen as FX 1  then submitted in cassette F  The remaining is submitted in cassettes A through B  A rubbery well demarcated white fibrous area measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x0 2cm  submitted in part in cassette C through D  Representative sections of normal breast is submitted in cassette E  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY  INFILTRATING CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  David William Rattner  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION , Unchecked.
