e breast at 12 o clock  This ill defined fibrous region is 1 8cm from the  anterior margin and 2 1cm from the posterior margin  A slightly firm   triangular white fibrous region is noted 2cm deeper to the ill defined fibrous  region along the anterior magin  0 3cm from the anterior margin and 5cm from  the deep margin  No clip is identified in either fibrous region  The region of  the anterior lower outer quadrant  an area with a previous biopsy and clip per  the clinical records  reveals white fibrous tissue with no mass or clip  identified  Lymph nodes are not detected in the lateral tissue     Additionally received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm aggregate of  irregular yellow white fibroadipose tissue  which is serially sectioned to  reveal unremarkable yellow pink fatty cut surfaces  The following  representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Hemorrhagic region in the inner middle breast with the region of the  clip and anterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between the hemorrhagic cavity and the center portion of  the breast    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Ill defined fibrous region at 12 o clock  nearest anterior margin in   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Posterior margin adjacent to ill defined fibrous region    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between ill defined fibrous region and anterior lower  outer quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Anterior lower outer quadrant tissue    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Central tissue    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Slightly firm fibrous region  entirely submitted  closest anterior  margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tissue intervening between well and ill defined white fibrous regions    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Remainder of ill defined fibrous region    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional tissue from lower outer quadrant     C  Received fresh