FICATIONS  2  CHANGES CONSISTENT WITH RADIATION EFFECT  3  REMOTE HEALING BIOPSY SITE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  BREAST  RIGHT  SUPERFICIAL MARGIN SUPERIOR FLAP   EXCISION  FIBROADIPOSE TISSUE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  BREAST  RIGHT  SUPERFICIAL MARGIN INFERIOR FLAP   EXCISION  FIBROADIPOSE TISSUE WITH SCANT BREAST PARENCHYMA  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  BREAST  RIGHT  SUPERFICIAL MARGIN LATERAL FLAP   EXCISION  1  FIBROADIPOSE TISSUE WITH FOCAL DENSE IRREGULAR FIBROSIS CONSISTENT WITH REMOTE BIOPSY SITE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  2  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN ONE LYMPH NODE  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  left breast   is a 19 x 17 x 5 5cm left modified radical mastectomy specimen  The anterior is inked blue  and the posterior is inked black  A short stitch designates the superior aspect  and a long stitch designates the lateral aspect  There is an REMOVED_DATE x 5 1cm tan white wrinkled areola  containing a 2 5cm curvilinear scar along the superior aspect and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm unremarkable everted nipple  Subjacent to the scar in the upper central to upper inner quadrant is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm firm tan white  stellate  focally hemorrhagic biopsy site  located 0 9cm from the anterior margin  8cm from the posterior margin  and 8cm from the nipple at the 12 o clock position  The biopsy site is surrounded by tan white fibrosis  Adjacent to the biopsy site within the upper inner quadrant are 2 hard nodules measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  respectively  located 0 8cm apart from each other  The nodules are located 2 8cm from the anterior margin  9 5cm from the posterior margin  and 7cm from the nipple in the 11 o clock position  There is also a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm calcified nodule in the upper outer quadrant at the 1 o clock position  located 2 5cm from the anterior